                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "pangenres"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f64dbaf-1638-3c28-9f20-efe7917e13b3",
                        "entry_id": "786c2110-2de9-3282-bc87-7a41bdebe45b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui s'identifie à tous les genres."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Genres humains et identités de genre"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "89125d66-7e56-4c45-a93c-fa2870d4b424",
                                "sense_id": "4f64dbaf-1638-3c28-9f20-efe7917e13b3",
                                "text": "Sociologiquement, le sexe ne se conçoit pas tant comme une donnée statique mais plutôt comme une catégorie dynamique. Ainsi, le genre est désormais regardé en tant que construction sociale et non pas comme une « fatalité » biologique. Les personnes androgynes, les individus a-genre ou non-genré, les queers, les trigenre ou les pangenre, constituent des nouvelles catégories recensées par les travaux sociologiques et auxquelles le droit ne peut ignorer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35ab3d58-3482-4f5a-ac39-4a0c1599b207",
                                "sense_id": "4f64dbaf-1638-3c28-9f20-efe7917e13b3",
                                "text": "Le conflit entre le sexe biologique et l’identité subjective contient un ensemble complexe de positions – rassemblées sous la catégorie « gender-queer » –, bi-genre, tri-genre, pan-genre, genre fluide, et même a-genre, car, d’une certaine manière, la fluidification atteint son apogée dans l’abolition de la sexualité elle-même."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd586dde-ef5c-4c57-abda-6e9384d0b5b6",
                                "sense_id": "4f64dbaf-1638-3c28-9f20-efe7917e13b3",
                                "text": "Elle se définit comme pangenre, genderqueer ou gender fluid. Ce qui veut dire, pour résumer ses mots, qu’elle s’identifie à tous les genres, donc à tout et à rien en même temps, mais jamais à un homme."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87ea36f6-0be6-442b-aa9b-14858e814557",
                        "source_entry_id": "786c2110-2de9-3282-bc87-7a41bdebe45b",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f64dbaf-1638-3c28-9f20-efe7917e13b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "pangender",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pangender",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                        "entry_id": "3c8ef7f0-2a06-3269-80f9-837e63104be4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Encompassing or including all genders."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a512c15-f5f7-4609-b117-6c9e59465972",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "These critiques distort Gilligan's thesis, it seems to me; she can be read as arguing that the morality of women is currently undervalued culturally and as calling for its reintegration into pangender morality, not for its use as a universal standard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2b009f-729c-48da-b698-c292c5cd028e",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "On one level, these changes many have served as a defensive maneuver to tone down some of the actor's pangender sexual magnetism and the homoeroticized responses associated with him as a male theatrical idol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "758e51cb-85b1-4514-be5f-219db02917f3",
                                                "sense_id": "59a7df5f-7f6b-3b89-b780-0c6f0fefc1ab",
                                                "text": "Then came the tidal wave of drugs, specifically heroin, and what had once been a haven for male alcoholics became a pangender hole-in-the-wall hideout for depraved junkies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                        "entry_id": "3c8ef7f0-2a06-3269-80f9-837e63104be4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Identifying with all genders."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d3d6735-f0c3-44a9-85e4-874a4f2d5c3b",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Born as a physical male, she now identifies as transfeminine, or pangender."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffee4cda-2796-41aa-b42f-209f0e8cb5ca",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Just don't be surprised if you meet someone who identifies as a \"non-binary neutrois pangender genderpunk autistic aspiequeer queer lithsexual punk anti-kyriarchist anarchist.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d21eca9e-c022-4792-a4bf-fc2a2ae63378",
                                                "sense_id": "a87954ac-c86d-3f4e-8788-6bcc2d00c975",
                                                "text": "Ranging from pangender to genderqueer and even intersex, the choices Facebook has included accurately reflects the diversity and differences of this day and age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43a89be5-e23b-48a9-bab4-4ab6de17a65e",
                        "source_entry_id": "786c2110-2de9-3282-bc87-7a41bdebe45b",
