                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a54a24a-64d9-45ca-a34f-7b86d682971d",
                                                "sense_id": "237ebf6b-7701-3649-9ab4-149ca82f5484",
                                                "text": "The omnigender term nipote (nee-POH-teh) can refer to either a grandchild of either sex or to a niece or nephew."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e8d9bb9-5a75-477e-9bdc-4a281667cf45",
                                                "sense_id": "237ebf6b-7701-3649-9ab4-149ca82f5484",
                                                "text": "Also bathrooms would all be unisexual, without differentiation. Basically, the ultimate goal of an omnigender society would be an acceptance of the full range of sexual and gender identities, from the most feminine of females to the[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a510ea8-7244-4d41-8e92-cce67a132bb1",
                                                "sense_id": "237ebf6b-7701-3649-9ab4-149ca82f5484",
                                                "text": "Charity Hundley had made, in fact, two leaps: one from enslavement, the other from the not female/not male omnigender role that human bondage forced on black women, who were and reproduced the labor force. Undoubtedly Charity Hundley's[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
